00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.730
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>昨日までのルール今日はただのルーズ</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>こわして　タントツゴール</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>走りつづけてないと</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>他に意味はないと</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>パンクな哲学なんだ</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>バイオリズムは　ツーバイリズムで</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>風景は　瞬間に　無数の線</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>俺を取り巻く風</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside 攻めて</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:52.750
Shadow...

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:57.010
All I'm going to do is carry out Maria's wish.

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.640
Maria doesn't want revenge.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:03.060
What?

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:08.270
No one wants their friend to do something horrible.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.400
Hang in there, Sonic!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.780
Hang in there, Shadow!

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.570
We're counting on you both.

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:23.780
Don't give up!

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.620
Please do your best!

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.290
Sonic! Shadow!

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:32.710
Shadow...

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.300
Please grant everyone's wish.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:40.090
I'm Shadow!

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.760
Shadow the Hedgehog!

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.060
Can you hear me?

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.020
Yeah!

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.190
I can hear you!

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.030
Chaos...

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.740
Control!

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:25.740
Episode 60

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:25.740
The Rebirth of Shadow

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.650
This is Chris.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:40.860
We've detected a Chaos Emerald. Can you come to the bridge right away?

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.450
Okay. I'll be right there.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.330
Why did I have that dream?

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.720
Look, Chris.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.180
Are you feeling okay, Chris?

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.190
Why?

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:15.400
You're sweating.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.320
I just had a bad dream.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.780
Oh, okay.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.170
This room...

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:48.970
It's here? I couldn't see the forest for the trees.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.850
How embarrassing!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.440
What is it?

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.560
It's the emergency alarm, stupid!

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.570
It's an intruder!

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.530
Somebody's here!
This is bad!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:15.660
Shadow? Why is he here?

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:16.790
Wasn't Shadow-

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.250
I don't care if you snoop around the ship.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:25.470
But I can't allow you to touch this.

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:28.090
So you knew I was on board this ship.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.430
What's this all about?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:35.140
Even someone as great as myself hasn't been able to wake him up yet.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.020
Get out!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.860
Fine.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:50.240
Dr. Eggman, we have an emergency!

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.030
It's you!

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.700
She's an intruder!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.790
Intruder?

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.500
She's a guest on my ship. Don't worry about it.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:11.100
That's the story. Let's be friends, Decoe and Bocoe.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.310
And Bokkun, you cutie.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:36.000
This is Planet Hobidon. There's no sign of life.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.210
That means it may have already lost its Planet Egg.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:43.710
Yes, it looks like they stole its Planet Egg awhile ago.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:48.880
Chris, can you zoom up the location where we detected the Chaos Emerald?

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:49.880
Roger.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.470
That's where the signal is coming from.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.560
The mechanical wreckage worries me.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.890
Let's split into two groups and investigate.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:04.020
Sonic and I will check out the Chaos Emerald, got it?

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.070
I'm the captain! That's for me to decide!

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:11.700
What are you talking about? In every heroic journey, there's always a beautiful woman!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.280
Sonic...

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.710
Cosmo and I will go this way.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.710
Why are you coming this way?

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:28.300
Can't you understand the feelings of a woman in love? You're so insensitive!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:31.340
It's not my fault! This is Tails's decision!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.090
Try to stay away as far as possible!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.310
This is the remains of a space colony.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.140
What does this mean?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:43.770
I don't know. We have to investigate further.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:56.620
A bottomless swamp! We better not fall in!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:08:00.620
Don't worry. If you fall in, I'll rescue you.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:04.250
Maybe the mud will be good for your skin.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:10.010
Stop picking on him!

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:15.180
Amy, are you receiving the data?

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.650
It's fine. No problems.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.580
Amy, be careful.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:42.040
I know! Make sure you don't lag far behind!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.250
Maybe she doesn't need us.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.250
Maybe not.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.070
What a large house.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:16.490
But Sonic and I can't live together in a dilapidated house.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.290
Let's enter.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.680
This way.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.610
Huh? It's supposed to be here...

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:51.480
What's up?

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.530
The Chaos Emerald moved!

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.040
What's this?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:10.170
It's a different room than before!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.750
What about the signal from the Chaos Emerald?

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.430
It's gone!

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.340
What's going on?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.100
Beats me.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.680
We must be caught in a trap.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:26.310
Let's keep going for now.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.820
There's someone over there!

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:43.700
Wait for me, Sonic!

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:54.000
Let's search for the colony's records.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.800
Understood. I'll do my best!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:05.680
Don't worry! I'll get it!

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.230
I found it!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.230
Are you all right, Cosmo?

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:17.940
Yes, I'm fine!

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.550
Oh, it's just a mirror.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.340
That scared me.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.100
Sonic!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.390
Amy!

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.860
What's going on?

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.160
Is this a haunted house?

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.870
Sonic, let's get out of here for now!

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.250
Okay! Hang on tight, Amy!

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.930
Same here!

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.470
And here!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.180
Damn!

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:35.940
And that's how Metarex destroyed our planet.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:41.990
The survivors built this space colony in hopes of someday reviving this planet.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:46.570
But then they attacked our colony.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:52.410
If anyone ever sees this, pass this message along.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:55.870
The Metarex are terrifying monsters.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.170
They're no longer alive...

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.920
Yeah...

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.770
I can't believe they even attacked the space colony! That's unforgivable!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.100
Chris?

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.150
What is it?

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:20.440
Were you daydreaming?

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.030
Just reminiscing.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:24.780
Reminiscing?

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:31.160
It was six years ago, even though only a year has passed in this world.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:35.790
There were two hedgehogs that saved my world.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:39.130
One was Sonic, and the other was...

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:45.420
If Shadow was here, what would he think about this battle against the Metarex?

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.890
There was a hero other than Sonic?

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.520
This is Blue Typhoon!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:59.360
Bad news! I can no longer detect Sonic!

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.480
What?

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.900
Chris, over there!

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.970
Sonic!

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.890
Thanks!

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:57.790
Sonic!

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:05.720
I succeeded in using the Chaos Emerald as bait to bring you here.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.590
What?

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:13.850
You've constantly interfered with our plans, but you won't after today!

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:15.480
Sonic!

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.440
I'll go!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.750
Sonic!

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:41.790
Okay!

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.090
Combo attack!

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.900
We can't attack it if it's not solid!

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:08.860
They're giving it their best.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.370
Should we leave, Dr. Eggman?

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:16.410
Just wait. Let's see how things turn out.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.080
What's the point of watching?

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:20.290
You don't know?

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:24.590
When they're both exhausted, we sneak in and take what we want.

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:28.800
Because we now have a trustworthy ally.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:32.010
You're already planning to use me?

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.220
It's the least you can do.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:39.100
When I finish what I need to do, I'll let you have the Chaos Emerald.

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:43.270
What are you talking about, Dr. Eggman!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.190
You're not making empty promises, are you?

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.610
You don't believe me?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.570
I'm not like a certain naïve hedgehog that you know.

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:57.910
Well, fine. This isn't the time for that anyway.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:04.170
Okay. You can count me in.

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.380
That's more like it.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:15.220
Energy charge completed! Target locked on!

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.180
Firing spread laser!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.740
Direct hit!

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:36.870
They did it!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:46.750
Did you think you could beat me with such a weak attack?

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:49.210
That's wishful thinking!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:52.430
Now it's my turn!

00:17:57.430 --> 00:18:00.640
Cream, focus the shield on the upper part of the ship!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.640
Roger!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.690
Get under the Blue Typhoon!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.240
The shield's power is decreasing!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:16.620
It'll only last for a few more minutes, Tails!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:19.790
I know. Just hang on a little longer.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.710
There it is!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:35.390
Inside the cloud is the Metarex core that swallowed the Chaos Emeralds!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:38.970
Guide Sonic using the Ring Road and attack it!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:39.970
Roger!

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.020
Sonic!

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.560
Ring Road!

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:50.940
Go on!

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:05.290
Now, Sonic!

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.290
You're finished!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.840
Attack!

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:19.470
Sonic!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:23.350
Sonic, it's all over for you!

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:32.320
Sonic is in trouble!

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:35.070
Sonic!

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:44.330
No! Don't come this way, Chris!

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:45.330
Sonic!

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:52.130
Chris!

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.640
Wait for me!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:05.850
They're leaving!

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:44.350
Chaos Control.

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:54.570
Chris!

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:32.730
That's...

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:46.450
Chaos Emerald...

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.960
Shadow...

00:22:00.010 --> 00:22:01.470
Shadow!

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:07.350
Chaos Control.

00:22:12.140 --> 00:22:13.480
Shadow...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:54.220
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:54.220
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:54.220
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:49.140
<i>Original Concept Created by</i>

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:49.140
<b>SEGA - SONIC TEAM</b>

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:52.720
<i>Excutive Producer</i>

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:52.720
<b>Yuji Naka</b>

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:56.140
<i>Producer</i>

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:56.140
<b>Tadahito Matsumoto</b>

00:22:54.220 --> 00:23:02.980
<i>愛するときめきさえ　涙に封じられてる</i>

00:22:54.220 --> 00:23:02.980
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.220 --> 00:23:02.980
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:22:56.850 --> 00:22:59.850
